      "question": "What counts as an active job role?",
      "answer": "A requisition that is open and accepting candidates. Closed and paused roles do not count, and you can reopen a role later without losing its candidates."
    },
    {
      "question": "Do we pay per user?",
      "answer": "No. Plans are priced by active job roles, so recruiters, hiring managers and interviewers can all review candidates on one subscription."
    },
    {
      "question": "What happens after the 14-day trial?",
      "answer": "You choose a plan or the workspace is paused. No card is taken up front, and your roles and candidates are kept for 30 days in case you come back."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can we change plan part way through?",
      "answer": "Yes. Upgrades take effect straight away and are charged pro rata. Downgrades apply from the next billing period."
    },
